1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:10,880
Add the indicators you use. Open Indicators and search for one.

2
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:19,580
EMA and RSI are now on the chart.

3
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,440
At the bottom of the list, Save current indicators keeps this set as a template.

4
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:29,410
Give it a name and press Enter.

5
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:33,950
The template is listed here, ready for any chart.

6
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:43,570
Indicators belong to the chart, so they stay when you change instrument.

7
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,940
GBPUSD opens with the same EMA and RSI.

8
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:56,210
Remove one with its X.

9
00:00:56,310 --> 00:01:07,620
Click the template to put its indicators back on the chart.

10
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:13,800
The X next to a template deletes it.

